    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Brand New Horror Attraction Is Now Under Your Watch!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grugles House Of Horror is soon to open for business! In the meantime, we need you to keep watch of the place and make sure nobody tries to get in, or out...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the night guard of a new  attraction in this <strong>horror game</strong>! Beware, you may get unexpected visitors during your shift, make sure you keep them away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make sure Grugles and his friends don't get into your room</strong> by closing the doors, <strong>check on River often</strong> to keep her at bay, <strong>click on Gaxter whenever he appears</strong> on the cameras and <strong>make sure that the Monkey is always wound up</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the cameras to see where everyone is, and check the room next to your office to see if anyone is at the door!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun point-and-click survival horror experience, unique mechanics, and scary jumpscare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning! This game contains loud noises, flashing lights, and lots of jumpscares!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cGrugles Entertainment is not responsible for any dismemberment on shift, any injuries will result in termination of employment.\u201d -Grugles Entertainment</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Brand New Horror Attraction Is Now Under Your Watch!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grugles House Of Horror is soon to open for business! In the meantime, we need you to keep watch of the place and make sure nobody tries to get in, or out...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the night guard of a new  attraction in this <strong>horror game</strong>! Beware, you may get unexpected visitors during your shift, make sure you keep them away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make sure Grugles and his friends don't get into your room</strong> by closing the doors, <strong>check on River often</strong> to keep her at bay, <strong>click on Gaxter whenever he appears</strong> on the cameras and <strong>make sure that the Monkey is always wound up</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the cameras to see where everyone is, and check the room next to your office to see if anyone is at the door!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun point-and-click survival horror experience, unique mechanics, and scary jumpscare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning! This game contains loud noises, flashing lights, and lots of jumpscares!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cGrugles Entertainment is not responsible for any dismemberment on shift, any injuries will result in termination of employment.\u201d -Grugles Entertainment</i></p>",
